          "kicker": "Exile effect",
          "heading": "Tomos Williams credits the Prem for Wales players' growing confidence",
          "body": "Saracens scrum-half Tomos Williams, one of nine England-based players in the Wales XV named for Saturday's test against Australia, told BBC Sport Wales that moving to England showed him English players were \"a lot more confident than us.\" He pointed to Aaron Wainwright, captain Dewi Lake and Jac Morgan as examples of recent movers. Flanker Morgan joined Gloucester from Ospreys in the summer and was named Prem player of the month in October."
        },
        {
