          "heading": "Felipe Contepomi accuses Montpellier of breaking Justo Piccardo workload deal before France",
          "body": "Argentina head coach Felipe Contepomi said on Friday that centre Justo Piccardo's absence from the side to face France was forced on the Pumas, not chosen. He said Piccardo had played 11 weeks in a row and that his GPS numbers had dropped against Italy, pointing to fatigue. Contepomi accused Montpellier's director of rugby Bernard Laporte and manager Joan Caudullo of breaking an agreement, leaving Argentina to manage the player's workload over the past fortnight. Lucio Cinti was named at outside centre in his place."
