          "body": "Nine Entertainment will show half of the 52 matches at next year's men's Rugby World Cup free on its TV channels and its 9Now streaming service, according to Rugby World's broadcaster guide. Every Wallabies fixture is among them. The rest of the expanded 24-team tournament, played across Australia, goes to Stan Sport, which also carries the Wallabies' 2026 season. Stan Sport packages start at $20 per month on top of a basic $9.99 Stan subscription."
